{"parse":{"title":"【伊利亚王国：纪传体（概述）】","pageid":270,"revid":7073,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%BA%93\" title=\"铃兰资料库\">铃兰资料库</a> &gt; <b>【伊利亚王国：纪传体（概述）】</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><div class=\"wiki-bot\">。此处为伊利亚历史库。</div></blockquote>\n<div class=\"BILIBILI-BOX BOX-4\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-2-1\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-title-1\">伊利亚历史馆</div>\n<div class=\"BOX-N\" style=\"\">\n<p><a href=\"/llzj/%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E8%AE%B0%E4%BA%8B%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%AB%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91\" title=\"【伊利亚王国：记事体本末（概述）】\"><span class=\"bili-section-normal section-wrap\" style=\"margin:5px 5px 5px 0px;\">【伊利亚王国：记事体本末（概述）】</span></a>\n<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"bili-section-normal section-wrap\" style=\"margin:5px 5px 5px 0px;\">【伊利亚王国：纪传体（概述）】</span></a>\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E9%87%8E%E5%8F%B2%EF%BC%88%E6%9C%AA%E6%94%B6%E5%BD%95%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91\" title=\"【伊利亚王国：野史（未收录）】\"><span class=\"bili-section-normal section-wrap\" style=\"margin:5px 5px 5px 0px;\">【伊利亚王国：野史（未收录）】</span></a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"toc-sticky\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"zh-Hans-CN\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">目录</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#伊利亚\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">伊利亚</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#阵营标识\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">阵营标识</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#势力范围\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">势力范围</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#王国军\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">王国军</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#迪塔利奥\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">迪塔利奥</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#角色描述\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">角色描述</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#角色事件评价\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">角色事件评价</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#资料卡片\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">资料卡片</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#角色介绍\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">角色介绍</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#角色台词\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">角色台词</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-4 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#角色事件\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">角色事件</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#古代伊利亚地图\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">古代伊利亚地图</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#倒吊人\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">倒吊人</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#现代伊利亚的诞生\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">现代伊利亚的诞生</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<style type=\"text/css\"> table.wikitable {width:100%;table-layout:fixed;}table.wikitable td, table.wikitable th{word-wrap:break-word;}h3 .mw-headline {font-size: 1.5em;}</style>\n<div id=\"noscrolltoc\"></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h1><span id=\".E4.BC.8A.E5.88.A9.E4.BA.9A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"伊利亚\">伊利亚</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：伊利亚\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<ul><li>伊利亚是一个位于大陆西侧，历史悠久的小国。</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>因蕴藏丰富晶石资源，伊利亚被卷入风暴中心。在各方势力包围下，王国希望能够开拓一条自由的道路。</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span id=\".E9.98.B5.E8.90.A5.E6.A0.87.E8.AF.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"阵营标识\">阵营标识</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"编辑章节：阵营标识\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:302px;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"△伊利亚地图.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/0kyz3hbgoy60ziw8rtaly75t8qkl0bg.jpg/300px-%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"189\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/0kyz3hbgoy60ziw8rtaly75t8qkl0bg.jpg/450px-%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/0kyz3hbgoy60ziw8rtaly75t8qkl0bg.jpg/600px-%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1320\" data-file-height=\"832\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"放大\"></a></div></div></div></div></dd>\n<dd>△伊利亚阵营</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8A.BF.E5.8A.9B.E8.8C.83.E5.9B.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"势力范围\">势力范围</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"编辑章节：势力范围\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:302px;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"△伊利亚地图.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/0kyz3hbgoy60ziw8rtaly75t8qkl0bg.jpg/300px-%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"189\" class=\"thumbimage\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/0kyz3hbgoy60ziw8rtaly75t8qkl0bg.jpg/450px-%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f5/0kyz3hbgoy60ziw8rtaly75t8qkl0bg.jpg/600px-%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1320\" data-file-height=\"832\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E2%96%B3%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.jpg\" class=\"internal\" title=\"放大\"></a></div></div></div></div></dd>\n<dd>△伊利亚地图</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.8E.8B.E5.9B.BD.E5.86.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"王国军\">王国军</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"编辑章节：王国军\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>负责保护王国不受侵犯</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\".E8.BF.AA.E5.A1.94.E5.88.A9.E5.A5.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"迪塔利奥\">迪塔利奥</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"编辑章节：迪塔利奥\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E6.8F.8F.E8.BF.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色描述\">角色描述</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"编辑章节：角色描述\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:262px;\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%BF%AA%E5%A1%94%E5%88%A9%E5%A5%A5%E7%94%BB%E6%A1%86.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"迪塔利奥画框.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/03/ekodtm6l7wq6z5tbkcw5sm55mlvuz3a.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"260\" height=\"311\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-file-width=\"260\" data-file-height=\"311\" /></a>  <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%BF%AA%E5%A1%94%E5%88%A9%E5%A5%A5%E7%94%BB%E6%A1%86.png\" class=\"internal\" title=\"放大\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>伊利亚王国的第一王子与实际掌权者，阴郁冷峻不怒自威的统治者。</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>迪塔利奥继承了父亲法里斯王的阴郁和容貌，因比两个弟妹年长不少而有疏离感。迪塔利奥不会轻易表露自己的情绪，行事不在乎他人的评价。他一手组建了倒吊人组织，在法里斯王隐退之后，依靠自己的强硬手腕维持着伊利亚的稳定。</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E4.BA.8B.E4.BB.B6.E8.AF.84.E4.BB.B7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色事件评价\">角色事件评价</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"编辑章节：角色事件评价\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd></dd>\n<dd></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\".E8.B5.84.E6.96.99.E5.8D.A1.E7.89.87\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"资料卡片\">资料卡片</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"编辑章节：资料卡片\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<table class=\"wikitable information\" style=\"float:right;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0px\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E6%8B%89%E7%BB%B4%E8%80%B6.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"拉维耶.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/af/72uwa8dzyc350pkxsmkem3h0b4zaqre.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"844\" data-file-width=\"1320\" data-file-height=\"743\" /></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#5bc0de\"><b>基本资料</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:60px\">名称\n</th>\n<td>拉维耶\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>类型\n</th>\n<td>图鉴\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>势力归属\n</th>\n<td>铃兰之剑\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>喜好\n</th>\n<td>美酒\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>讨厌\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"heimu\">中箭</span>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#5bc0de;\"><b>额外内容（像素立绘）</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E6%9C%89&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"可能有（页面不存在）\">可能有</a>、<a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9A%82%E6%97%B6%E6%9D%A5%E8%AF%B4%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"暂时来说没有（页面不存在）\">暂时来说没有</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h4><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E4.BB.8B.E7.BB.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色介绍\">角色介绍</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"编辑章节：角色介绍\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>拉维耶并不是铃兰本地人，多年前来到小镇定居，并组建了佣兵团保护着小镇，受到镇民和佣兵们的爱戴与支持。</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>精通各种武器和小队战术的强大战士，见识广阔，绝非一般流浪者，但本人对过去的经历绝口不提<span class=\"heimu\">从倒吊人退役，和索菲亚是好友</span>。</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>长久的奋斗下，伊利亚民众对独立的诉求越来越强烈。</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E5.8F.B0.E8.AF.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色台词\">角色台词</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"编辑章节：角色台词\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>“来，让我们敬大英雄一杯。”</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>“现在最重要的是找出真相，伊利亚需要这个真相！”</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>“就拜托你了，保护好大家。”</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E4.BA.8B.E4.BB.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色事件\">角色事件</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"编辑章节：角色事件\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>（以下为编者胡编，只是举例）</dd>\n<dd>（<a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%8C%E9%99%A8%E8%90%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%8D%E3%80%8D&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"「陨落的天才」（页面不存在）\">「陨落的天才」</a>）</dd>\n<dd>（<a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%8C%E7%A5%9E%E7%A7%98%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E5%88%80%E3%80%8D&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"「神秘的大刀」（页面不存在）\">「神秘的大刀」</a>）</dd>\n<dd>（<a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%8C%E8%86%9D%E7%9B%96%E4%B8%AD%E7%AE%AD%E3%80%8D&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"「膝盖中箭」（页面不存在）\">「膝盖中箭」</a>）</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8F.A4.E4.BB.A3.E4.BC.8A.E5.88.A9.E4.BA.9A.E5.9C.B0.E5.9B.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"古代伊利亚地图\">古代伊利亚地图</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"编辑章节：古代伊利亚地图\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".E5.80.92.E5.90.8A.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"倒吊人\">倒吊人</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"编辑章节：倒吊人\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>摄政王的直系部队，擅长通过一些非常手段为伊利亚处理棘手的问题...</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".E7.8E.B0.E4.BB.A3.E4.BC.8A.E5.88.A9.E4.BA.9A.E7.9A.84.E8.AF.9E.E7.94.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"现代伊利亚的诞生\">现代伊利亚的诞生</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%8A%E5%88%A9%E4%BA%9A%E7%8E%8B%E5%9B%BD%EF%BC%9A%E7%BA%AA%E4%BC%A0%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E6%A6%82%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%89%E3%80%91&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"编辑章节：现代伊利亚的诞生\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>第二次圣/战苏莱曼帝国战败，在教皇的压力下，伊利亚从苏莱曼帝国的版图中分离出来，并立圣教为国教，成为教皇国的附庸邦国之一。</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<p><br />\n</p></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163504\nCache expiry: 86400\